The  memories are a bit fucked up, everything it's fuzzy when you haven't drenk for a while. 
The weird part is when the mouth gets so dry that it's actively fighting your ability to drink. 
Dad is trying to get in contact with the Marsian authorities to get us on a shuttle. he's saying we're gonna be fine, that we have enough water to survive the cut off.
We're just gonna have to ration correctly. 

-> Fuck that!
    ... I'm not gonna see my friends die. the system is almost out of water at this point. fuck earth,
    -> and fuck the Marsians!
        their fucking treaties it's not doing shit for us! 
        -> I'll call Grig, I want to help however I can.
            <<jump RecruitReb>>
        -> Maybe dad's contact knows how I can help. 
            <<jump RecruitMar>>        
    -> hopefully the Marsians will help us.
        <<jump RecruitMar>>
        
-> Hopefully he's right
    I really couldn't handle this on my own.
