The letter came a few weeks later. a few weeks too late, when a lot of people where already gone, we didn't even have the means to support so many eagle flights. 
But there it was, green pixels on a black screen. 

25-12-2279; 14:50 | Płaskowyż Olimp - Mars

Dear sir Joh M. Johiński, born 2nd of March, 2255, Marowo
As a martian citizen residing in the  you're called to take action in the ongoing dispute with the earthian. 
Please report to the closest martian embassy to you. 

